# about:data (cavekit-site-data.md R3, T-663): the test form's site sets a cookie, keeps 4 KB in localStorage, and a login
# and a note are submitted (the note goes into the form history). about:data lists the site with its counts; its page
# shows the cookie (its value on demand), the stored data and its size, the login's count; Pop-up windows set to Block
# for the site is what the engine then holds; the cookie removed; Forget this site, after its confirm, empties the
# site and it leaves the list. The form history holds the note, which is removed.
id: site-data-page
section: Privacy and site data
item: about:data lists the site with its cookies, stored data and logins; its page shows and removes a cookie, changes a permission, shows the stored data; Forget this site clears it all; the form history lists and removes a typed note
shells: enyo mochi mojo
prefs: jihad.compat.trace=true signon.rememberSignons=true browser.formfill.enable=true
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-login.html
kit: cavekit-site-data.md R3
fixture: site-data-clean
wait rect user 30
probe submit '(function(u,p){document.getElementById("user").value=u;document.getElementById("pass").value=p;document.getElementById("note").value="hello jihad";return "filled "+u;})("jihad-data","data-pass-8")'
tap go
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-ok
expect dialog answered 8
wait text sent "sent jihad-data" 15
launch about:data
wait text sites "192.168.1.245" 10
wait text 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-counts' "stored" 10
expect text-has 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-counts' "1 login"
tap 'sel:.site-row[data-site="192.168.1.245"] .site-open'
wait text cookies "jihadtest" 10
tap 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-show'
wait text 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-value' "1" 4
wait text storage "KB" 10
expect text-has site-logins "1 saved login"
pick 'sel:.perm-row[data-perm="popup"][data-origin="http://192.168.1.245:8077"] select' 2 3
wait text status "Pop-up windows for http://192.168.1.245:8077: Block" 6
launch about:data?site=192.168.1.245
wait rect 'sel:.perm-row[data-perm="popup"][data-origin="http://192.168.1.245:8077"][data-value="2"]' 10
tap 'sel:.cookie-row[data-name="jihadtest"] .cookie-remove'
wait text status "removed" 6
expect text-lacks cookies "jihadtest"
tap 'sel:#forget'
wait text forget-row "Forget everything" 4
tap 'sel:#forget'
wait text sites "Sites" 20
wait quiet 'jihad-never-logged' 3
expect text-lacks sites "192.168.1.245"
launch about:data?pane=forms
wait text forms "hello jihad" 10
tap 'sel:.form-row[data-value="hello jihad"] .form-remove'
wait text status "Removed" 6
expect text-lacks forms "hello jihad"
